WEBVTT

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:37.070
You're just the same as 
Kadowaki and all those guys.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.950
Ganging up on one person...

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:40.740
Just lay off already!

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:45.930
Appear...

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:50.040
Hayagami Homura!

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.460
Say "appear!"

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.590
Appear!

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:11.480
This light is...

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:12.920
Kamui!

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:16.090
It can't be!

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.650
Lord Kannagi's Homura is...

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.840
Subside.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:35.050
I don't believe it. You're a Sho.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.340
Lord Kannagi! The place is collapsing!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:01.860
Hayagami {B: sorry if this wasn't clear in the preview on ep 1, I left it out there since the romaji just repeats the kanji ^^; but thanks for filling it in for the final, it looks more complete that way heh}

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.540
I still can't reach Arata.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.200
Don't worry, Mom.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.710
I'm sure his battery just died.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.750
But Arata is so careful about that.

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:15.920
I could understand that 
happening to you, but...

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.970
Naked from the waist up? Seriously?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.930
I heard he looks like an idol! 
Maybe he's filming a drama!

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.360
Filming?

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.630
Come on, Nao!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.430
You're just forgetting about Onii-chan?

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.060
There he is!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.940
Whoa, he really is naked!

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:40.790
Onii-chan?!

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.740
Arata!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:43.980
Did you call me?

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.350
I can't find them.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.460
Where did they run to?

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.770
<i>That Kamui...</i>

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.910
<i>I can't believe it 
nullified Homura's flames.</i>

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.820
Does this mean a new 
Hayagami has appeared?

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:14.140
This is the Goshintai that has 
been handed down by our ancestors.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:16.470
It is called a Hayagami.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.450
Hayagami... It's a god?

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:24.910
All the gods of Amawakuni 
exist in the form of swords.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:29.910
The sword wielded by Lord Kannagi 
is one of them as well.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.410
His sword is the god of flames.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:40.920
And the light you produced that sealed 
it was also a Kamui, a great divine power.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:44.170
A divine power? But why do I...

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:51.520
You have been chosen as a Sho, 
one who wields the power of the gods.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.300
Chosen? Me?

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.290
Master Arata.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:02.030
Your meal is ready. 
It's all things you like.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:07.030
If you eat this, you might recall 
the memories you lost in the forest.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.450
<i>In her eyes, I look like him.</i>

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:16.800
<i>That Arata guy with the same name as me.</i>

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.190
You're not hungry?

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:23.830
N-Not really. Sorry.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.530
Master Arata...

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:41.800
<i>Hinohara Arata...</i>

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:46.270
<i>To think that our Hayagami has 
chosen not my grandson, Arata,</i>

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:50.070
<i>but this boy who came 
from an unknown world.</i>

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.330
Akachi, what do you want?

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:03.200
I believe this matter has 
been entrusted to me.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:06.760
Yes, but the plan has been changed.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:08.880
Bring him back alive.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.970
He will be convicted before the people

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:15.090
to remind them of our authority 
as the Twelve Shinsho.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:16.770
A trial, eh?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:21.320
I'll ask you again. 
Where are they hiding?

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:23.520
I-I don't know! It's the truth!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.790
Stubborn fool!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.430
This is Lord Kannagi 
of the Twelve Shinsho.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:53.280
I'm just a high school kid.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:58.010
I'm supposed to just go to school, 
hang out with my friends...

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:02.360
<i>Hinohara and I were never friends.</i>

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:05.320
<i>I won't acknowledge you.</i>

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:09.820
Master Arata...

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:12.980
This tastes good even when it's cold.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.610
You'll get your memories back.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.400
Even if a wave recedes, 
it will eventually return.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:31.650
There's no telling when the wave 
that's breaking now will return,

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:34.700
but it most definitely will.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.360
I'm sorry. I thought that 
would make a good example,

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.690
but it didn't really work.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:46.660
But if you just be 
yourself and don't panic,

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.180
your memories will return.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:49.830
You're wrong.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.130
I'm not the Arata you know.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:57.910
I'm Hinohara Arata, someone 
from a world you don't know.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.700
Yes, that's right.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.710
Uh... N-No, I'm saying...

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.210
You were able to wield the Hayagami,

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.290
but you're from another world, right?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.550
That was just a fluke or 
some kind of mistake.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:13.630
Yes, you managed to wield the 
Hayagami by mistake, right?

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:21.660
Don't worry. I know you 
will return to normal.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:24.510
I'll always be by your side.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:27.890
And I'll always believe...

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:41.410
<i>But, to stop the Kamui of 
one of the Twelve Shinsho...</i>

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.280
<i>Could this Hayagami be...</i>

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:00.290
Huh? It's not here...

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.620
H-Hold on a second!

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.700
It's not here!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:05.440
Huh?

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:09.320
Master Arata, where's the 
Michihi-no-tama I gave you?

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:10.600
Wh-What?

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.610
The one that looks like this.

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.560
It was a precious gift 
from Princess Kikuri.

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:18.780
Did you lose it?

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.180
Uh, well...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.360
I'm sorry, I guess. Probably.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.430
I guess I have no choice.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:32.960
Now, don't lose this one.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:34.560
Okay...

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.430
Master Arata, when you 
saved me from Lord Kannagi,

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:42.970
you were very dashing.

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:50.120
This is good!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.780
That looks tasty.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.490
Mistress Makari!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:04.340
You will come with me. If you resist, 
I will kill the old woman.

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.000
Or...

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.260
Would you rather pick 
up where we left off?

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:17.390
Draw your Hayagami.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:19.010
Draw my...?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.230
Arata!

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.470
You won't draw?

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.420
Bind him!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.180
Lord Yorunami.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.140
It's been a long time since I saw 
the moons over the capital, Hiruko.

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:42.780
I just received word.

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:46.040
Yes. It seems he's been captured.

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:49.960
You already knew? 
Then, pardon my intrusion.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:57.570
Such oppressive darkness.... 
What a terrible omen...

00:10:57.900 --> 00:11:01.050
This is the darkness we have created.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.800
Our nation is about to change.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.580
Don't you screw with me,

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:30.250
Hinohara.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:44.680
We will formally decide what to 
do with you at tomorrow's trial.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.470
Murdering the princess 
is a serious crime.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.520
I didn't kill her! I'm innocent!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.880
I was in the Kando Forest...

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:53.480
Where your memories were devoured 
and you became someone else?

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.340
Then, who are you?

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:01.740
If this goes on...

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:23.380
Hey! You're the guy from before!

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:24.570
My room?

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:34.720
Hey, are you okay?

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.310
Why...

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:39.230
Why are you in my room?!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.400
Why? Because you're there?

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.560
So, it's true?

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:53.210
Why did you kill the princess?!

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:57.080
Idiot! I would never do that!

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:59.250
You didn't kill her?

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.860
Of course not!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.670
It was Kannagi who killed her!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:04.560
Kannagi?

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.090
It was him?

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:10.160
The rest of the Twelve Shinsho 
just stood by and watched.

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:11.900
They're all accomplices.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:16.900
The princess trusted the Twelve Shinsho 
above all, and they betrayed her.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:19.040
They betrayed her?

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.410
I'll never forgive them.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:25.090
They don't know how much they 
hurt her, how sad she felt.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.070
Can I trust you?

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:33.650
Can I trust you and 
what you just said?

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:36.290
What's wrong with you?

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.460
I'm afraid to trust...

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.580
No, that's not it.

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:45.220
I'm afraid of my trust being betrayed.

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:50.000
So I'll never trust anyone again.

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:55.310
That so? Then, don't trust me.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.600
It's like Gram said.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:01.270
The more someone says "trust me," 
the less you can trust him.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:04.740
So, you shouldn't trust me.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:08.050
But it's gonna be a pain 
to both be named Arata...

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:09.410
Okay.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:13.240
Call me Arata, and I'll 
call you Hinohara.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.080
Let's go with that, okay?

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:17.820
You're...

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.820
Oh, also...

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:24.100
Are Gram and Kotoha okay?

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.590
Yeah, they have guards with them.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:27.730
They haven't been taken.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:29.510
I see...

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.490
I see...

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.130
Good...

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:38.090
Sorry all this is happening.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.800
I don't know what I can do,

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:43.730
but I'll try to find a way 
to get us back to normal.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.310
It's not your fault.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:49.500
Whatever the circumstances, 
we're both worried

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.660
and alone.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:53.520
You're right...

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.120
Oh, yeah...

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.530
Apparently, I've been chosen as a Sho.

00:14:58.530 --> 00:14:59.400
What?

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:01.110
The Hayagami awoke.

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:03.340
It might be a fluke, though.

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:08.130
That's incredible! If you can use 
a Hayagami, you can fight them!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.560
Fight them?

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:10.660
Yeah!

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:14.140
We can go back to normal, right?

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.790
Sure we can!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.590
It's fading...

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:21.690
Arata!

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:22.900
Mom?!

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.900
Mom, I'm here! I'm right here!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.450
Mom! Mom! Mom...

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.090
Is someone else in here?

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:34.330
J-Just talking to myself.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:40.910
Mom, I'm here...

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:02.520
The trial for the assassination 
of the princess will now begin.

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:06.810
We, the Twelve Shinsho, as the 
faithful advisors to the princess,

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:09.010
will conduct the deliberations.

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:12.710
If any oppose, please raise your hand.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:17.090
In that case, this court
 is now in session.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:23.250
Master Arata...

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.790
This is a formal trial.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:28.310
Even if he's sentenced, 
we have some time.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:32.470
Kotoha, could I ask a favor of you?

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:34.640
Yes.

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:39.950
Arata of the Hime Clan is a heinous fiend
 who disguised himself as a woman

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.750
to succeed the throne,

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:46.310
and attempted to take the 
life of our august princess.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.580
Using his privileged 
position in the Hime Clan

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:52.110
to commit murder is 
a very serious crime.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.110
I didn't! Don't lie!

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:56.170
All of you, behold.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:05.950
The princess used her Amatsuriki at 
the last moment to preserve her life,

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.210
and still roams the boundary 
between life and death.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.420
Oh, she looks terrible...

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.420
That's

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:15.080
the princess?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:17.230
It's a capital offense!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.290
Kill him! Kill him now! Kill him!

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:20.310
There's no need for deliberations!

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.250
Kill him!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.060
The death penalty for him!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.350
Kill him! Kill him!

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:27.840
Silence!

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.330
We were present at the 
scene of the crime,

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.320
and we witnessed the whole tragedy.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.620
We, the ones charged with 
protecting the princess,

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:41.770
deeply regret that we did not detect 
anything amiss and prevent the outcome.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.780
So it's the same in any world.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.040
Trust people, and you'll be betrayed.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.040
Cut the crap... Just cut the crap!

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:55.670
You're the ones who plotted 
to murder the princess!

00:17:56.540 --> 00:18:00.440
Are you saying that we, 
the ones who shared a deep

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:02.310
bond of trust with the
 princess, betrayed her?

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:05.210
It's true, isn't it?! 
What's this Twelve Shinsho crap?

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:07.870
I'll never forgive cowards like you!

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:09.690
You're all scum!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.410
Did you ever consider 
the princess's feelings?!

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:14.680
How much do you think it hurt her

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.510
to be betrayed by people she trusted?!

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:17.700
How sad do you think she felt?!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.720
You don't have the right 
to control the gods!

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:23.590
You're just traitors and murderers!

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:25.850
You little...

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:33.430
Are you so desperate 
to run from your sin?

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.700
So desperate you would 
say we betrayed her?

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.160
I'm so disgusted, I have no words.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.850
Yes. Our grief knows no bounds.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:46.570
You know nothing of how long 
we have served the princess.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.100
Even our Hayagami weep.

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:52.100
How cowardly can he be?!

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:55.400
To call the Twelve Shinsho 
murderers is preposterous!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.210
Execute him right now!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.030
Kill him! Kill him!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:01.280
<i>What's with that?</i>

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.850
<i>We shouldn't get involved with him.</i>

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:03.930
<i>Poor thing.</i>

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:05.910
<i>What the hell? Stay away from him!</i>

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.550
I will now deliver the verdict.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:14.380
Arata of the Hime Clan,

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.590
you are hereby exiled to Gatoya.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.600
How terrifying...

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:22.200
Gatoya, the ultimate hell...

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:25.510
Normally, you would receive 
the death penalty,

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:27.980
but that would not suffice for you.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:32.690
Rather, you shall reflect upon 
your sin in your living hell.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:38.190
Arata...

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.830
<i>Arata, I will not kill you.</i>

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:52.520
<i>Not until I know what 
that Hayagami really is.</i>

00:19:57.950 --> 00:19:58.880
Mom...

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:04.250
Looks like she snuck in 
here hoping to see you.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.510
Take her with you to Gatoya, 
just as she wished.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.470
Kotoha!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.820
Why would you do something so foolish?

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:21.530
I told you, I'll always be by your side.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:26.620
But, thank goodness 
they didn't find this.

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:28.280
My bag?

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:29.550
And...

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:31.720
This.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:33.370
The Hayagami?

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:37.020
A Hayagami is useless if not 
in the hands of its Sho.

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:39.100
Mistress Makari entrusted it to me.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:42.220
If I have this, maybe I can break out!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.720
Oh, that's right! Using the Kamui!

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:47.470
Appear!

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:50.510
Appear!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.900
Nothing's happening.

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:57.150
Why?

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.260
Damn it!

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:04.240
Arata...

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.080
Arata...

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.800
What's going on?

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.390
Master Arata...

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:32.640
The light...

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:45.800
Princess Kikuri!

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:47.070
The princess?

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:51.140
So, we finally meet, Arata.

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:55.740
Arata, my new Shinsho...

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:00.080
Please, hear my request.

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:03.450
Request?

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:42.330
So you're the newbie I've heard about?

00:23:42.330 --> 00:23:43.860
What was that?

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.020
Master Arata!

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:47.560
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:23:47.560 --> 00:23:49.400
Will you betray them as well?

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:50.950
I will protect her!

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:52.530
Give Kotoha back to me!

00:23:51.010 --> 00:25:53.990
The Reckoning

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:53.990
The Reckoning has begun...
